OL,3,AZoe Kleinman: Nobody is irreplaceable -
OL,4,Aunless you're Jensen Huang
OL,5,
OL,6,FRemember the tech boss and his head of
OL,7,FHR, both married to other people, who
OL,8,Fwere caught on camera at a Coldplay
OL,9,Fconcert with their arms wrapped around
OL,10,Feach other?
OL,12,FTheir horrified reaction went viral,
OL,13,Fand the pair both resigned. Astronomer,
OL,14,Fthe firm where they both worked, said
OL,15,Ftheir actions had fallen short of its
OL,16,Fstandards.
OL,18,FCompared with the scandal which has
OL,19,Fengulfed Nvidia chief executive Jensen
OL,20,FHuang in recent weeks, that Coldplay
OL,21,Fkiss cam moment now feels rather tame.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
